\section{Experiments}
% NOTION N-X01
We conduct comprehensive experiments to investigate the following questions: (1) Does \ours{} improve task success over WAM and VLA baselines? (2) Does UWBC improve stability and portability across heterogeneous WBCs? (3) Can manipulation priors generalize to new whole-body coordination in OOD settings? (4) How does each mechanism contribute to the performance of \ours{}?

\subsection{Experimental Setup}

